                <pb facs="1010" n="948" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg948"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 60.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Note from the ministry of exterior
                    relations.</hi></head>
                <p>The minister of foreign relations of the United States of Venezuela has the honor
                    to inform the honorable minister resident of the United States, that Monday, the
                    28th instant, is the day of the national festival commemorative of the
                    liberator, and that for this reason the flag of the republic will then be
                    displayed at the federal palace.</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName>Caracas</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1878-10-26">October 26,
                        1878</date>.</dateline></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jehu Baker</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Minister Resident, &amp; c., &amp; c., &amp; c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
